303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 107 0 R
/T (This brief is the fifth and final report in a five-part CGIAR- OPPD - SAWONET policy brief series drawing on key informant interviews with pastoralist women-led, humanitarian, climate-resilience and peacebuilding organizations across Kenya, Somalia, Tanzania and South Africa. It builds on the flagship brief's overarching findings \(Brief 1\), the adaptation-leadership evidence in Brief 2, the rangeland governance and peacebuilding findings in Brief 3, and the GESI lens on pastoral mobility in Brief 4, completing the series' account of the interconnected climate, conflict, mobility, governance and education challenges facing pastoralist women across the region.)
/E (This brief is the fifth and final report in a five-part CGIAR- OPPD - SAWONET policy brief series drawing on key informant interviews with pastoralist women-led, humanitarian, climate-resilience and peacebuilding organizations across Kenya, Somalia, Tanzania and South Africa. It builds on the flagship brief's overarching findings \(Brief 1\), the adaptation-leadership evidence in Brief 2, the rangeland governance and peacebuilding findings in Brief 3, and the GESI lens on pastoral mobility in Brief 4, completing the series' account of the interconnected climate, conflict, mobility, governance and education challenges facing pastoralist women across the region.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
