/Title (The evidence in this brief supports a specific conclusion, that the barrier to aligning education with pastoral mobility is not a lack of known solutions. Mobile schools, flexible calendars, distance and radio-based learning, and community-led programmes addressing the social drivers of dropout have all been piloted, studied and, in some cases, proven effective over several decades of research across multiple countries and contexts.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1167 0 R
/Next 1182 0 R
>>
endobj
1177 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Somalia data point is relevant here; a 78 percent exclusion rate for pastoralist children is not the result of an unsolved technical problem, but of a persistent gap between documented best practice and actual investment.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1167 0 R
/Prev 1182 0 R
>>
